                  title: "Call Graph Construction",
                  color: "var(--color-accent)",
                  desc: "The scanner builds a CallGraph that maps function-level caller→callee relationships across Python (Django/Falcon/DRF/FastAPI) and JavaScript/TypeScript (Express/Node). Supports local calls, Celery task dispatches, signal handlers, and event emitters.",
                },
                {
                  num: "2",
                  title: "Topology Clustering",
