                dedicated GraphQL schema buckets via <code class="inline-code">_build_graphql_buckets()</code> in specializations.py.
                <strong class="text-[var(--color-ink)]">Call graph:</strong> Python (Django/Falcon/DRF/FastAPI) and JS/TS (Express/Node)
